	measure 'Revenue Rank' = ```
			
			SWITCH (
			    TRUE (),
			    ISINSCOPE ( 'Jobs I'[Target] ),
			        RANKX ( ALLSELECTED ( 'Jobs I'[source], 'Jobs I'[Target] ), [TotalRevenue],, DESC, DENSE ),
			    ISINSCOPE ( 'Jobs I'[account] ),
			        RANKX ( ALLSELECTED ( 'Jobs I'[account] ), [TotalRevenue],, DESC, DENSE ),
			    ISINSCOPE ( 'Jobs I'[client_name] ),
			        RANKX ( ALLSELECTED ( 'Jobs I'[client_name] ), [TotalRevenue],, DESC, DENSE )
			)
			
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: 03 Ranking
		lineageTag: a4357d65-7e4a-432f-9a3f-8585dccc7637

	measure 'Top N Flag' = IF ( [Revenue Rank] <= [Top N Value], 1, 0 )
